{
  "_readme": "The world is generated from a seed (js/world/worldGen.js, run in a Web Worker): several continents on a wide sea with mountain spines, rivers, lakes, deserts in the rain shadow and cold tundra in the north. What you can change here: how big the world is, how many villages and continents it has, what the player's home starts with, and what each kind of ground holds. NOTE: the grid is 360x240 hexes of 24 world units; a hex is a field, not a county, and one expedition claims a whole district of hexes (js/territory.js).",

